<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">我们的地理老师也是一流的。不仅能画中国的地图，还能精准地画出各个国家包括</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">小国家，和</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">省内的地图</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">。我们当时上地理课都很认真，很多小国家的首都我们都知道，真是受益匪浅。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION>
