<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">阔别母校半个世纪，他深情地说：“我<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">的第一个母亲是祖国，给我尊严；第二母亲是母校，给我知识和文化；第三个母亲是生我养我的亲娘，给了我生命。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="85375"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(89,155,171) 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(89,155,171) 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0.5em 0px 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; BORDER-TOP: rgb(89,155,171) 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(89,155,171) 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.3em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 668px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(254,254,254); BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); FONT-SIZE: 1em; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); FONT-WEIGHT: bold; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-width="100%"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0.6em; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2em; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0.6em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0.6em; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-