<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 2em; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 5px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; color: rgb(127,127,127);">
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: rgb(89,155,171); PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN>陶文钊院士在校史展览馆看到自己当年的老师们。他感慨地说，“<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">老师们辛勤、认真、尽职地教育我们，终身难忘。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">他记得人体解剖课的老师，“</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">高一上了一年的人体解剖课，</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">第一次知道</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">人还有生物钟，人的工作、学习、休息都要根据一定的节律。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”他记得劳作课的老师，“老师教我们按自己肩宽用木头做了个</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">衣架，我很喜欢，用了很多年，一直带到北京。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">他期望：母校要坚持，在注重培养学生科学素养的同时，<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">注重人文气质的培养，“这</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">关系到人的成长，如此才能为国家培养更多的德智体美全面发展的人才</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”。</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="85375" data-color="rgb(172, 29, 16)" data-custom="rgb(172, 29, 16)"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(172,29,16) 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(172,29,16) 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0.5em 0px 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; BORDER-TOP: rgb(172,29,16) 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(172,29,16) 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.3em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 668px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(254,254,254); BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); FONT-SIZE: 1em; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); FONT-WEIGHT: bold; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-width="100%"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0.6em; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2em; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); BORDER-TOP-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0.6em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0.6em; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); FONT-SIZE: 1.2em; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); PADDING-TOP: 0.6em" data-brushtype="text">徐扬生院士</SECTION><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: rgb(172,29,16); BORDER-LEFT: transparent 0.8em solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px auto; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; HEIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(172,29,16) 0.8em solid; BORDER-RIGHT: transparent 0.8em solid; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0.5em; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2em; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,254,254); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0.5em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0.5em; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0.5em"> 
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 2em; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 5px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; color: rgb(127,127,127);">
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">徐扬生院士记得自己当年每门学科的老师，“<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">敬业的</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">老师是我们一生的榜样。</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”他还记得自己的</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">英文老师，“那时大家都害怕英文，</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">不想学英文，老师就将‘</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">半夜鸡叫</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">’改编成英文话剧，让大家边演边学，后来大家学英文的兴趣逐渐浓厚</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">作为人工智能领域的专家，徐扬生院士说，30-50年后，目前社会上将会有一半的职业消失。“<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">我们的教育要做什么？”这位香港中文大学（深圳）校长认为，</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">要让学生多学点人文社科类的知识，着力培养学生综合能力，“而需要记忆、</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">计算和</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">逻辑思维的知识，怎么学将来也拼不过智能机器人！</SPAN><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">”</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 1em; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“人的强项在哪里？在直觉的部分，在想象和创造的部分，而我们的中学教育，常常忽略了这些！”</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">10月5日，在绍兴一中“求真大讲堂”院士系列讲座活动中，许溶烈、徐杨生、沈士团、陶文钊等给该校师生带来了各自擅长领域的讲座。<BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">而包括各种讲座在内的、丰富的社团活动，令劳春燕念念不忘。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">她记得，“我当时热衷于社团活动，还是学校的学生会主席。”<BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“老师觉得我应该去当外交官，但外交学院当时并不在浙江招生。我的老师于是专门写了三页纸的推荐信寄过去。”虽然外交学院还是没有到绍兴来招生，但这事让劳春燕一直感恩在心，“什么样的老师能为学生这样做？”</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">绍兴一中不仅有很多经典社团，还鼓励学生自创新的社团。热爱古典音乐的劳春燕希望有更多的同学和她一样喜欢古典音乐，开始筹办一次古典音乐的讲座。“我去绍兴人民广播电台借了很多古典音乐的磁带，认真地准备了讲座的内容。”但到了讲座开始的时间，她到阶梯教室一看，只坐了6个人。她坦言，恨不得大哭一场。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">可是，社团指导老师的一句话，让她记了一辈子——“哪怕台下只坐了一个人，那都是你的知音。”</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“你究竟能不能做你自己，坚持你喜欢并且是你认为你应该做的事情，而不是那么地在乎眼前的掌声和喝彩？”每每人生旅途上碰到困难，劳春燕说自己就会想起老师的教诲。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“老师教会我要心中有坚持的梦想和信念，教会我做人的道理，这些，是一生都有用的！”</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">（摘自  浙派教师微信公众号    <A href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NTY2MDM4MQ==&amp;mid=2247484716&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5b6855bfae89162d38c0fe9b0ba4a6a8&amp;chksm=e94a6a9ede3de3887026d06c413c3a31f2f9ec4c2ed9c020463628e651e7402154aad1bdcc56&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=10070jizQL5pYeiQn9rLLa5W#rd">http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NTY2MDM4MQ==&amp;mid=2247484716&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5b6855bfae89162d38c0fe9b0ba4a6a8&amp;chksm=e94a6a9ede3de3887026d06c413c3a31f2f9ec4c2ed9c020463628e651e7402154aad1bdcc56&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=10070jizQL5pYeiQn9rLLa5W#rd</A>）</P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION></DIV>
    
